Negative control for the tri-state TREATMENT dispatch (P1-R3).

Points the Bounced column's uischema at the OTHER treatment, so the column that
must render a label-less toggle group renders the labelled All|Yes|No button
group instead. Any assertion that reads the treatment from the uischema —
rather than from the branch — goes red; an assertion that merely counts
"some control rendered" stays green, which is the point.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

